{
  "slug": "foresight-engine",
  "name": "Foresight Engine",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Strategic intelligence plugin for Claude Code. Give it any real-world forecasting question and it produces a structured four-scenario analysis (Probable, Plausible, Possible, Preferable) backed by live web signals, historical analogues, and deterministic probability scoring. Built on IFTF foresight methodology: STEEEP framework, Futures Cone, Cross-Impact Analysis, and Backcasting. Two-layer architecture: Python handles all deterministic arithmetic; Claude handles web search, reasoning, and scenario writing.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `hard-predict-future` (Activate this agent for any future-oriented question that requires deep quantitative analysis, historical precedents, and structured scenario planning), `soft-predict-future` (Activate this skill for ANY future-oriented question).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install foresight-engine@claude-community` from `isanthoshgandhi/foresight-engine`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
